  <title><app>Virtualbricks</app> Help</title>
  <p><app>Virtualbricks</app> makes labs of virtual machines and of the switches, cables, taps and tunnels between them, and runs them on this computer.</p>
  <p>Press <key>F1</key> in a window for the page about it; in the settings of a brick, for the page about its kind. The settings of a brick, an event or a disk image, and the <gui>Settings</gui> window, have a <gui>Help</gui> button too.</p>
